Package: SDR
Title: Successive Difference Replication Variance Formulas
Version: 0.9.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Eric", "Slud", , "slud@umd.edu", role = "aut"),
    person("Tim", "Trudell", , "timtrudell@gmail.com", role = "cre")
  )
Author: Eric Slud [aut], Tim Trudell [cre]
Maintainer: Tim Trudell <timtrudell@gmail.com>
Description: Provides functions to compute Successive Difference Replication (SDR) variances under stratified simple random sampling. Includes functions for calculation of permuted estimates and for arbitrary choice of D cycling parameter. See the `SDR-package` help (`?SDR`) for package notation or the SDRpkg.RLog, either in the inst/ folder or in the SDR package directory after installation (`system.file("SDRpkg.RLog", package="SDR")`). 
